  "longBusinessSummary": "Deutsche Pfandbriefbank AG provides commercial real estate and public investment finance. It operates through Real Estate Finance and Non-Core segments. The Real Estate Finance segment provides financing for professional property investors, which includes national and international property companies, institutional investors, property funds, and medium-sized companies, as well as regionally oriented customers to finance properties comprising office buildings, residential properties, retail and logistics properties, and business hotels. The Non-Core segment offers financing eligible for Pfandbrief cover for the provision and improvement of public infrastructure and non-earmarked financing to the public sector. It operates in Germany, France, Austria, the United States, Poland, Other Europe, the United Kingdom, Spain, Sweden, Finland, Italy, Czech Republic, Portugal, Hungary, and internationally. Deutsche Pfandbriefbank AG was incorporated in 1997 and is headquartered in Garching bei Munchen, Germany.",
